message: "If you use the MM-DEV code or data in your research, please cite this software repository and the associated manuscript."
title: "MM-DEV: Code and Data for Early Warning Signals to Anticipate Critical Transitions in High-Dimensional Systems"
type: software
version: 1.0.0

