repository-code: "https://github.com/koushikgarain/MM-DEV"

abstract: >-
 This repository contains the code and data associated with the manuscript
 "Early warning signals to anticipate critical transitions in high-dimensional
 systems." It provides the implementation and datasets used to evaluate MM-DEV,
 a multivariate extension of the Dynamical Eigenvalue (DEV) framework for
 detecting early-warning signals of critical transitions in high-dimensional
 dynamical systems. The repository includes analyses of simulated
 Lotka-Volterra and Ricker systems, long-term Lake Zurich ecological data,
 and experimental methane-producing bioreactor data.

